{"chapter":{"sura":86,"name_arabic":"الطارق","name_english":"The Nightcomer","transliteration":"At-Tariq","juz":30,"origin":"Meccan","revelation_order":36,"verse_count":17,"display_basmalah":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ"},"verses":[{"sura":86,"aya":1,"key":"86:1","arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","english":"By the heaven, and by the nightly visitor","transliteration_html":"Wa<b>al</b>ssam<u>a</u>i wa<b>al</b><u>tta</u>riq<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Waalssamai waalttariqi"},{"sura":86,"aya":2,"key":"86:2","arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","english":"(and what will show you what is the nightly visitor?","transliteration_html":"Wam<u>a</u> adr<u>a</u>ka m<u>a</u> a<b>l</b><u>tta</u>riq<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Wama adraka ma alttariqu"},{"sura":86,"aya":3,"key":"86:3","arabic":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","english":"It is the brilliant star):","transliteration_html":"A<b>l</b>nnajmu a<b>l</b>thth<u>a</u>qib<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Alnnajmu alththaqibu"},{"sura":86,"aya":4,"key":"86:4","arabic":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍۢ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌۭ","english":"there is a guard over every soul.","transliteration_html":"In kullu nafsin lamm<u>a</u> AAalayh<u>a</u> <u>ha</u>fi<i><u>th</u></i><b>un</b>","transliteration_text":"In kullu nafsin lamma AAalayha hafithun"},{"sura":86,"aya":5,"key":"86:5","arabic":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","english":"So let man consider from what he was created.","transliteration_html":"Falyan<i><u>th</u></i>uri alins<u>a</u>nu mimma khuliq<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Falyanthuri alinsanu mimma khuliqa"},{"sura":86,"aya":6,"key":"86:6","arabic":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍۢ دَافِقٍۢ","english":"He was created from an effusing fluid","transliteration_html":"Khuliqa min m<u>a</u>in d<u>a</u>fiq<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Khuliqa min main dafiqin"},{"sura":86,"aya":7,"key":"86:7","arabic":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","english":"which issues from between the loins and the breast-b